{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"球状集"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"球状集"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>球状集</strong> (globular set) 是可由如下对象"},{"Local":{"url":"探测","text":"探测"}},{"Plain":"的结构:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>点;</li>\n<li>线段;</li>\n<li>两个线段 $\\bullet \\rightrightarrows \\bullet$ 围成的 $2$-胞腔;</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一般范畴中的这种结构称为"},{"Local":{"url":"球状对象","text":"球状对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>球状集可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"有向图","text":"有向图"}},{"Plain":"在高维的推广.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>球状脉</h3>\n<p>类似于"},{"Local":{"url":"奇异单纯集","text":"奇异单纯集"}},{"Plain":", 拓扑空间 $X$ 也给出一个球状集 $\\Pi X$, 其 $n$-胞腔就是 $n$ 维球面到 $X$ 的连续映射.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯集","text":"单纯集"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}